menu "Kamstrup MULTICAL 403 example"

    config MBUS_SIMULATE_METER
        bool "Simulate the M-Bus meter in software (no wiring needed)"
        default n
        help
            Skip the real M-Bus UART exchange entirely and synthesize a
            MULTICAL 403-style telegram in software instead, using the same
            slowly-varying flow/temperature model as
            tools/kamstrup-403-sim (sines for flow, dT and return
            temperature; power, energy and volume derived from them).

            Useful for bench-testing Matter commissioning and the heat-meter
            data model on a board with no M-Bus wiring at all -- a bare dev
            board, or the custom PCB before the analogue M-Bus circuit has
            been brought up. mbus_uart_init() becomes a no-op and
            MBUS_MODE_NKE_ONLY is not meaningful with this enabled, since
            there is no link layer to reset.

endmenu
